bout 350 words. Let's draft around 350. Need count. Let's write with placeholders: [Date], [Vendor Contact Name], [Vendor Company Name], [Your Name], [Your Company Name]? Company name is a name. Maybe [Your Company Name] is placeholder for name. But user says from a small software company; could use [Company Name]. Need only names and dates placeholders. So no [GPU Model], [Program Name]. Use \"your upcoming GPU\" and \"developer program\".\n\nNeed ensure word count about 350. Let's draft and count.\n\nDear [Vendor Contact Name],\n\nI am writing on behalf of [Company Name], a small software company that develops an open-source inference engine for deploying machine learning models on heterogeneous hardware. We are requesting early access to the developer program for your upcoming GPU.\n\nOur engine provides a lightweight runtime, model compiler, and deployment tooling that allow developers to run inference workloads with minimal configuration. Because the project is open source, it is used by a growing community of researchers, startups, and independent developers who need reliable performance across multiple hardware platforms. Early access to your GPU would allow us to begin driver, runtime, and compiler integration before public launch, rather than after the product is widely available.\n\nThis timing matters for several reasons. First, inference performance is highly sensitive to memory", "top2": [[[1596, -0.0018581715412437916], [1421, -7.003323078155518]], [[1144, -1.2874686035502236e-05], [1902, -11.86064338684082]], [[310, -0.37782448530197144], [4087, -1.248010277748108]], [[5707, -0.740790069103241], [4087, -1.027043104171753]], [[310, -5.483642325998517e-06], [303, -12.784368515014648]], [[1156, -2.3841887468734058e-06], [6163, -13.744460105895996]], [[25, -0.011050920002162457], [9859, -5.174907207489014]], [[328, -0.06441417336463928], [9357, -2.983535051345825]], [[7734, -3.612106593209319e-05], [2523, -10.93861198425293]], [[264, -3.5048145946348086e-